          "$type": "ShaderFX",
          "$id": "fx0",
          "active": true,
          "code": "// @whimtex-effect Light/Tint\r\n// @control(_Opacity)\r\n// @param float _Opacity = 1 [0 .. 1]\r\n// @param color _Tint = #FFFFFF\r\n// @param float _Brightness = 1 [0 .. ~3]\r\n// @param float _LeftFade = 40 [0 .. 256]\r\nfloat4 ApplyFX(float2 uv,float4 color){float leftPx=max(0,uv.x*_CanvasSize.x-0.25);color.a*=_LeftFade>0?smoothstep(0,_LeftFade,leftPx):1;color.a*=smoothstep(0,1.5,min(uv.y,1-uv.y)*_CanvasSize.y);return float4(color.rgb*_Tint.rgb*_Brightness,color.a*_Tint.a*_Opacity);}\r\n",
